 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prayer Song — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Through dance and the beat engraved in your body, you gain the ability to buff yourself and debuff your opponent even without a domain.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, as a bonus action for 1 Cursed Energy you can start catching the beat of a fight. The effects depend on how long it has been active and end if you are stunned, paralyzed, grappled, restrained, or knocked prone.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Turns Active</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Effect</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Your AC and Dex Saves increase by +2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Your Enemies AC decreases by -2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">You can add your Cursed Energy modifier to your attack rolls</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Your opponent has disadvantage on attacks and you have advantage on saving throws</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Your attacks deal additional damage equal to your proficiency</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
   "chat": ""
  },
